%% Chain state lifecycle: warmup, adaptation freeze, sampling, checkpoint.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Warmup
  Warmup --> Warmup: adapt step sizes\n(no retained draws)
  Warmup --> Sampling: adaptation frozen
  Sampling --> Sampling: step + thinned draw
  Sampling --> Checkpoint: every N iters\n(atomic RNG + tree + params)
  Checkpoint --> Sampling: continue
  Checkpoint --> [*]: interrupted
  [*] --> Resume: from checkpoint
  Resume --> Sampling: exact bit-identical continuation
  Sampling --> [*]: budget reached
